  <p>The app is provided "as is" and "as available" without warranties of any kind. We don't guarantee it will be uninterrupted, error-free, or that messages will always be delivered, received or scheduled sends will go out on time (scheduled messages require your Mac to be on and the app running). Keep backups of anything important.</p>

  <h2>Limitation of liability</h2>
  <p>To the fullest extent permitted by law, Ember &amp; Oak is not liable for indirect, incidental or consequential damages, or for lost data, profits or opportunities, arising from your use of the app. Our total liability for any claim is limited to the amount you paid for the app, or zero if it was free. Nothing here limits liability that can't legally be limited.</p>

  <h2>Ending use</h2>
  <p>You can stop at any time by removing your accounts and deleting the app. We may suspend or end access to our sign-in and read-receipt services if they are misused or put at risk.</p>

  <h2>Changes to these terms</h2>
